{"id":"maneh","name":"Maneh","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:maneh"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Maneh","text":"Portion (Ezek. 45:12), rendered “pound” (1 Kings 10:17; Ezra 2:69; Neh. 7:71, 72), a weight variously estimated, probably about 2 1/2 or 3 lbs. A maneh of gold consisted of a hundred common shekels (q.v.). (Comp. 1 Kings 10:17, and 2 Chr. 9:16)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2091","lemma":"זָהָב","xlit":"zâhâb","gloss":"gold, figuratively, something gold-colored , as oil, a clear sky","kjv":"gold, fair weather","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H3967","lemma":"מֵאָה","xlit":"mêʼâh","gloss":"a hundred","kjv":"hundred, -th), sixscore","count":3,"share":0.75}],"verses":["1Kgs.10.17","2Chr.9.16","Ezra.2.69","Neh.7.0"],"related":[{"id":"weights","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"beaten-work","type":"lexical","strong":"H2091","why":"both lead with זָהָב (H2091)"},{"id":"beryl","type":"lexical","strong":"H2091","why":"both lead with זָהָב (H2091)"},{"id":"gold","type":"lexical","strong":"H2091","why":"both lead with זָהָב (H2091)"},{"id":"idol","type":"lexical","strong":"H2091","why":"both lead with זָהָב (H2091)"},{"id":"ivory","type":"lexical","strong":"H2091","why":"both lead with זָהָב (H2091)"},{"id":"revelation","type":"lexical","strong":"H2091","why":"both lead with זָהָב (H2091)"},{"id":"azgad","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"longevity","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"parosh","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"pashur","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"pharosh","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"},{"id":"target","type":"lexical","strong":"H3967","why":"both lead with מֵאָה (H3967)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":